<title>USA: TABLE - American Physicians Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - American Physicians Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.07		    $0.06</p>
<p> Net			    296			258</p>
<p> Revs			 1,937		    2,148</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,270		    4,360</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.16		    $0.15</p>
<p> Net			    661			653</p>
<p> Revs			 4,344		    4,757</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,259		    4,353</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: American Physicians Service Group Inc said its net income for the second quarter and the first six months of 1997 include a gain of $1,899,000 on the sale of a 20 percent interest in a subsidiary, and a loss of $798,000 on the disposal of its computer software segment.</p>
<p>The company reported a Q2 net loss from discontinued operations of $97,000 vs net income of $18,000, and a six-month net loss of $138,000 vs loss $1,000.</p>
